fields.aboutUs:
At Whangamatā kindergarten our vision is to provide quality, inclusive and accessible early childhood education where tamariki are seen as life long learners.

We create a culture and teaching and learning practices where:

- tamariki are confident, creative, connected and actively involved in decision making on a daily basis; our environment promotes curiosity, exploration, problem-solving and sustainability;
- tamariki experience being in nature. By learning to love Papatuanuku we believe tamariki will want to be a kaitiaki and care and protect her;
- manaakitanga looks like family; warm, welcoming, kind and caring;
- we regularly explore beyond our gates to connect with our community and celebrate the uniqueness of our place.

We would love for you to come and visit us.
